  "description": "**Upcoming manhwa : Date still not fixed**\n\nJeong Dajeong lives her life by a strict, unbreakable set of rules. Her boundaries are absolute, her emotions are compartmentalized, and her ultimate bucket-list dream is simple: to sit alone in a park and eat a hamburger without caring about the world.\n\nKim Haeda is a man who looks exactly like a discarded, high-bred pedigree cat—gorgeous, fragile, and explicitly marked by the hands of whoever raised and abandoned him.\n\nWhen Dajeong’s rigid world collides with Haeda’s messy reality at a glamorous Singapore coffee expo, she finds herself stepping into a dark underbelly of dirty corporate dealings to pull him out of trouble. Intrigued and cornered, Haeda offers her a deal. But Dajeong already has the next step perfectly mapped out.\n\n*\"Then… for starters, shall we begin by dating? You and I.\"*\n\nThe terms are set. The contract is signed. Everything is going exactly according to her manual… or is it?",
